# Brass's Tunnel-Grinder: "discard any number of cards, then draw that many cards plus one": discarding none draws one (CR 608.2d),
# and with nothing in a graveyard no one descended, so there is no counter at the end step.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Brass's Tunnel-Grinder
Island
Island
Island
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

