Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Brass's Tunnel-Grinder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose()
? Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 0
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 4
[T1 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Brass's Tunnel-Grinder.Counters.Bore = (absent)

